Event Loop allows javaScript to perform non-blocking operations.

1) Call stack executes code.
2) Web APIs handle async tasks.
3) Callback Queue holds completed tasks.
4) Event Loop moves task from queue to stack.

   
   
                  Event Loop
   Call stack  ⇔     ↻       ⇒  Callback Queue
              ↖       ↕       ↗           
                  Web APIs
                

